    Preserve the initial thread identity in synchronous tracing
    
    [hermit2, degraded-unresolved, gpt-6-astra, devbig014, role=impl]
    
    Plain Language Summary and Project Impact
    
    Synchronous verification logging now consumes the same PID/TID slot as the
    existing file and stderr logging paths by calling their existing tracing
    thread equalizer. This preserves the expected initial Detcore identity while
    keeping verification evidence synchronous. The retained ptrace/KVM parity
    failures remain failures; this does not repair or qualify clock parity.
    
    Task: astra-lane-drains-hermit-reverie-pr-queues-to-zero
    https://github.com/rrnewton/hermit/pull/2945

